{"meta":{"total_count":317},"next_page":"/api/v2/latest?category=all&paginate=20&tags=products-developer-tools&fields=&site_id=2&is_main_hero=False&image_format=webp&show_hero=True&cursor=2","results":[{"page_id":85124,"headline":"Here's what developers can do with the latest Google Play updates.","author":"","author_list":[],"analytics_properties":{"has_carousel":"no","has_image":"no","has_audio":"no","has_video":"yes","hero_media_type":"none"},"content_type":"Short Post","slug":"google-play-updates-google-io-2026","tags":"google-play,products-developer-tools","secondary_tags":"Developer tools","go_live_date_time":"2026-05-21|17:00","days_since_published":2,"content_category":null,"word_count":0,"summary":"At Google I/O, we introduced new ways for developers to expand their reach and scale their business with less complexity.We’re expanding th…","full_url":"https://blog.google/feed/google-play-updates-google-io-2026/","url":"/feed/google-play-updates-google-io-2026/","published":"2026-05-21T17:00:00Z","hero":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/IO26_313_PKLS_2.max-300x300.format-webp.webp","main_hero_image":null,"category":"short-post","tag":"google-play","tag_eyebrow":"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/platforms/google-play/","tag_name":"Google Play","eyebrow":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-05-21 17:00:00+00:00\" aria-label=\"May 21\">May 21</time> / Google Play","show_byline":null,"sitespace":"","sitespace_render":"","published_node":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-05-21 17:00:00+00:00\">May 21</time>","published_readable_date":"May 21","body_text":"<div class=\"rich-text\"><p data-block-key=\"j9krp\">At Google I/O, we introduced new ways for developers to expand their reach and scale their business with less complexity.</p><p data-block-key=\"1t1oq\">We’re expanding their reach by meeting users where they are.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\"91s6j\"><b>On the Store:</b> Play Shorts provides a glimpse into an app’s look, feel and functionality, while Ask Play allows conversational search for finding the right app.</li><li data-block-key=\"fcbba\"><b>Beyond the Store:</b> We’re surfacing apps directly in the Gemini app on Android and web while expanding content discovery across more surfaces via Engage SDK.</li><li data-block-key=\"3jkgg\"><b>In games:</b> Play Games Sidekick, our in-game overlay that gives players instant access to gaming information, including tips, rewards and new social updates to deepen player connections.</li></ul><p data-block-key=\"7kmhm\">Learn more about these updates and the ways we’re helping developers grow their businesses on Google Play in our <a href=\"https://goo.gle/play-io26\">Android developer blog post</a> or watch the <a href=\"https://goo.gle/whats-new-in-play-io26\">I/O keynote</a> recording.</p></div>","short_body":[{"type":"video","value":{"video":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fwLiTPtPHjw","alt_text":"YouTube video showing speakers on stage going over Google Play's announcement's at I/O","image":{"id":67677,"renditions":{"small":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-100x100.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-100x100.format-webp.webp","width":100,"height":56,"alt":"unnamed"},"small_retina":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-200x200.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-200x200.format-webp.webp","width":200,"height":112,"alt":"unnamed"},"medium":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-500x500.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/unnamed_FvucHK0.max-500x500.format-webp.webp","width":500,"height":281,"alt":"unnamed"},"medium_retina":{"url":"https://stor